70px] w-full overflow-hidden"><div class="relative h-[30vh] w-full overflow-hidden bg-black sm:h-[64vh] md:h-auto md:min-h-0"><div class="relative h-full w-full md:h-auto"><picture><source srcSet="/_next/static/media/Bangalore-banner.01a1266j2o.cn.webp" media="(max-width: 767px)"/><img alt="Bangalore luxury apartments and upcoming projects banner" loading="eager" width="1536" height="1024" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full md:h-auto md:max-h-[70vh]" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:auto" src="/_next/static/media/Bangalore-banner.01a1266j2o.cn.webp"/></picture></div></div></section><section id="about" class="bg-[#f0f5f9] px-5 py-14 md:px-10 md:py-20 font-sans"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-5 text-left"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-[#C8A84B]"></span><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#C8A84B]">Bangalore Real Estate Insights</p></div><h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#002855] tracking-tight leading-tight font-serif">Explore Luxury &amp; New Projects in Bangalore</h1><div class="w-16 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#C8A84B]"></div><div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-left"><p>Bangalore&#x27;s<!-- --> <a href="/" class="text-[#C8A84B] hover:underline"><strong>real estate market</strong></a> <!-- -->continues to grow, with a wide range of luxury apartments and thoughtfully planned homes. From well-designed communities to modern high-rise buildings, the city offers homes in locations that suit families, working professionals, and investors alike.</p><p>Several<!-- --> <a href="/projects" class="text-[#C8A84B] hover:underline"><strong>new projects launched in Bangalore</strong></a> <!-- -->in 2026 are bringing fresh housing options to different parts of the city. Whether you are looking in North, East, South, or Southeast Bangalore, you can find<!-- --> <strong>luxury apartments, gated communities, and premium residences</strong> <!-- -->to suit different requirements and budgets.</p><p>Price is only one part of choosing the right property. It is also important to consider the location, connectivity,<strong>developer&#x27;s track record, amenities, construction quality, and planned infrastructure</strong>. Many luxury apartments in Bangalore are located close to IT parks, business districts, schools, hospitals, shopping areas, and major transport routes.</p><p>Bangalore’s <strong>residential real estate market</strong>continues to grow across key regions and established growth corridors, with<!-- --> <a href="/projects" class="text-[#C8A84B] hover:underline"><strong>East Bangalore, North Bangalore, South Bangalore, and West Bangalore</strong></a> <!-- -->emerging as prominent residential destinations. Improved connectivity, expanding infrastructure, employment hubs, and better social amenities are driving demand for<strong>upcoming apartments, premium apartments, and luxury residential projects</strong> <!-- -->across these areas. With a growing selection of<!-- --> <strong>new residential projects in Bangalore</strong>, homebuyers and investors can explore properties that suit their lifestyle, budget, and long-term investment goals.</p><p>Buyers are increasingly choosing upcoming luxury projects and premium gated communities for their spacious floor plans, green surroundings, lifestyle amenities, and well-planned layouts. Depending on your needs and budget, you can explore 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK projects in Bangalore across a variety of locations.</p><p><a href="/projects" class="text-[#C8A84B] hover:underline"><strong>Compare new residential projects in Bangalore</strong></a> <!-- -->based on location, layout, amenities, connectivity, and investment potential. Before making a decision, verify the project&#x27;s pricing, approvals, and RERA registration details directly with the concerned developer.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center"><div class="w-full max-w-[520px] h-[350px] sm:h-[450px] md:h-[500px] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-white/60 relative group"><img alt="Explore Luxury Apartments in Bangalore" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/images/about/main page.webp"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#002855]/60 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="projects" class="bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 font-sans"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 md:mb-16 space-y-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3"><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-[#C8A84B]"></span><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#C8A84B]">Featured Properties</p><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-[#C8A84B]"></span></div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#002855] tracking-tight font-serif">Upcoming Projects in Bangalore</h2><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">Explore Bangalore&#x27;s most exciting new launch and upcoming residential projects from renowned developers with world-class amenities and strategic connectivity.</p></div><div class="space-y-8"></div><div class="mt-12 md:mt-16 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-[#002855] hover:bg-[#0B1F3A] text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl border border-[#C8A84B]/40 transition-all duration-300 active:scale-95 group" href="/projects"><span>View More Projects</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 text-[#C8A84B] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="investment-roi" class="bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 font-sans border-t border-gray-200/70"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3 mb-14"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3"><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-[#C8A84B]"></span><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#C8A84B]">High Capital Growth &amp; Rental Returns</p><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-[#C8A84B]"></span></div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#002855] tracking-tight font-serif">Investment &amp; ROI Potential in Bangalore Real Estate 2026</h2><div class="w-16 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#C8A84B] mx-auto my-3"></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-14"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-sm hover:border-[#C8A84B] hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#002855] group-hover:text-[#C8A84B] transition-colors">14-18%</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#C8A84B] bg-[#C8A84B]/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">Capital Growth</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0B1F3A] text-sm sm:text-base mb-2">14% - 18% Annual Appreciation</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Rapid capital appreciation across new launch projects in Bangalore 2026 driven by expanding metro lines and expressway corridors.</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-sm hover:border-[#C8A84B] hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-3