84B]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check w-4 h-4 text-[#C8A84B]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>RERA Registered Channel Partner</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="why-choose" class="bg-white px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 font-sans border-t border-gray-100"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3 mb-14"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3"><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-[#C8A84B]"></span><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#C8A84B]">Investment Highlights</p><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-[#C8A84B]"></span></div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#002855] tracking-tight font-serif">Why Choose Bangalore For Your Next Property Investment ?</h2><div class="w-16 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#C8A84B] mx-auto my-3"></div><p class="text-gray-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-center">Bangalore is regarded as India’s best option for real estate investments because of its rapidly growing tech industry, huge rental industry, and property appreciation over time. Being the fastest-growing Asian tech city, Bangalore is able to combine job generation and a high quality of life, hence, offering great resilience for real estate investors</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6"><div class="bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-[#C8A84B] hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center flex flex-col items-center group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[#002855] mb-5 group-hover:bg-[#002855] group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0B1F3A] text-base mb-2">Fastest-Growing Tech Capital</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Silicon Valley of India generating major IT exports and commanding continuous high rental demand.</p></div><div class="bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-[#C8A84B] hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center flex flex-col items-center group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[#002855] mb-5 group-hover:bg-[#002855] group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0B1F3A] text-base mb-2">Consistent Appreciation</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">High capital growth across North, East, and South growth corridors backed by large infrastructure upgrades.</p></div><div class="bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-[#C8A84B] hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center flex flex-col items-center group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[#002855] mb-5 group-hover:bg-[#002855] group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users-round w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0B1F3A] text-base mb-2">Vibrant Rental Market</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Massive influx of global tech talent, MNCs, and corporate professionals ensuring strong occupancy rates.</p></div><div class="bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-[#C8A84B] hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center flex flex-col items-center group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[#002855] mb-5 group-hover:bg-[#002855] group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-award w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0B1F3A] text-base mb-2">High Quality of Life</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Top international educational institutions, green landscaped micro-markets, and multi-specialty healthcare.</p></div></div><div class="mt-14 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#002855] via-[#0f3464] to-[#1e4d8c] p-8 sm:p-10 text-white text-center shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-48 h-48 bg-[#C8A84B]/20 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold font-serif mb-3">Looking for the Best Investment Property in Bangalore?</h3><p class="text-white/80 text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6 leading-relaxed">Get expert guidance, latest price sheets, and priority site visit assistance for top luxury and upcoming projects.</p><button type="button" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A84B] hover:bg-[#b89539] text-[#002855] text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer active:scale-95">Enquire Now</button></div></div></section></section><footer><section id="contact" class="py-20 px-4" style="background:linear-gradient(140deg, #0B1F3A 0%, #1A3555 100%)"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color:#C8A84B">Register Your Interest</p><h2 class="font-bold text-xl md:text-4xl text-white mb-4 leading-tight">Unlock Exclusive Access to Bangalore&#x27;s Most<br/><span style="color:#C8A84B">Anticipated Development</span></h2><div class="gold-divider mb-6"></div><p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">Fill in the form and our property advisors will get in touch within 24 hours with detailed project brochure, floor plans, pricing, and site visit scheduling.</p><ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-300"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span style="color:#C8A84B">✔</span> Pre-launch pricing advantage</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span style="color:#C8A84B">✔</span> Priority floor selection</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span style="color:#C8A84B">✔</span> Complimentary site visit</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span style="color:#C8A84B">✔</span> No spam - discreet inquiry process</li></ul></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-2xl"><h3 class="font-semibold text-xl text-gray-900 mb-6">Enquire About Project</h3><form class="space-y-4"><input type="text" placeholder="Your full name" required="" class="w-full border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm" value=""/><input type="tel" placeholder="+91 XXXXX XXXXX" required="" class="w-full border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm" value=""/><input type="email" placeholder="yourname@gmail.com" required="" class="w-full border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm" value=""/><button type="submit" class="bg-[#C8A84B] w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold mt-2 cursor-pointer text-white/80 hover:bg-[#b08c3a] transition-colors">Submit Enquiry - Get Brochure</button></form><p class="text-xs text-gray-400 text-center mt-4">By submitting, you agree to be contacted by our advisory team. Your data is protected and never shared.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#F0ECE7] pt-8  text-[#0F3464] text-center w-full"><div class="pb-4 px-4 md:px-6 "><div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-center align-items-center gap-2 gap-md-5 mb-2"><p class="mb-5"><strong>Agent RERA :</strong> <!-- -->PRM/KA/RERA/1251/310/AG/260323/006990</p></div></div><h2 class="text-center py-5 font-bold text-xl">Disclaimer</h2><article class="text-center text-black pb-4 md:text-sm text-[8px]">Marketed By - Authorised Channel Partner | This is not the official website of developer property, it belongs to authorised channel partners for information purposes only. All rights for logo &amp; images are reserved to the developer. Thank you for visiting our website.<br/>© <!-- -->2026</article></div><div class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-4